@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Hiragino Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam ArrowColor #506776
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #486477
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F0F6F8
skinparam packageBorderColor #899DA9
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam databaseBackgroundColor #F5F2E9
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #F0F6F8
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #899DA9
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E9
skinparam noteBorderColor #C5B88B
skinparam dpi 170
skinparam ranksep 15
skinparam nodesep 20
participant "UI / shared client" as UI
participant "Public Operation" as API
participant "Domain / UoW" as D
UI -> API : Typed input / identity / context
API -> D : Authorize / check rules and conflicts
alt Rejection or conflict
 D --> UI : Reason / re-enter or re-read
else Committed
 D -> D : Commit mutation
 D --> UI : Committed result
 UI -> API : Read current state
 API --> UI : View / read result
end
note over UI, API
 Check execution status when the response is unknown.
 A failed UI refresh does not justify repeating the mutation.
end note
@enduml
